/* ent = the entry of a signed comb digit d in [-8, 8] from a table of eight affine entries, in
   constant time: every entry is read and the one of index |d| - 1 kept by word masks (d = 0
   keeps the identity); a negative digit swaps Y+X with Y-X and negates 2dT. */
